{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "20276",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 5.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "Oh, morning, doctor. Is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.61,
      "end_seconds": 10.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.74,
      "end_seconds": 24.68,
      "duration_seconds": 12.94,
      "text": "honestly, it's burning when I pass urine, and my family pushed me to come i took the morning off to come in today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.73,
      "end_seconds": 29.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Right, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.99,
      "end_seconds": 33.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Probably about two weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.24,
      "end_seconds": 37.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Is there something that settles it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.09,
      "end_seconds": 44.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Right, I get some relief from drinking water."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.4,
      "end_seconds": 48.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.59,
      "end_seconds": 68.19,
      "duration_seconds": 14.6,
      "text": "I mean, when it starts I tend to get a sudden urgent need to go as well. The sudden urgent need to go? That's been for about four days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.27,
      "end_seconds": 74.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "Have you been needing to go all the time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.9,
      "end_seconds": 79.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Erm, yes, about the same, two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.15,
      "end_seconds": 103.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any vomiting, new partner, vaginal discharge or loin pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.53,
      "end_seconds": 110.26,
      "duration_seconds": 5.73,
      "text": "No, no vomiting, new partner, vaginal discharge or loin pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.02,
      "end_seconds": 114.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Right, your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.04,
      "end_seconds": 119.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Right, no, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.85,
      "end_seconds": 134.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.35,
      "end_seconds": 142.8,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "Yes, diabetes. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.82,
      "end_seconds": 146.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.51,
      "end_seconds": 150.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I've, I've got heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.61,
      "end_seconds": 153.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "right, and anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.57,
      "end_seconds": 171.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.71,
      "end_seconds": 175.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "No surgery, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.61,
      "end_seconds": 181.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.34,
      "end_seconds": 185.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.61,
      "end_seconds": 190.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.77,
      "end_seconds": 195.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.81,
      "end_seconds": 198.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Right, are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.9,
      "end_seconds": 203.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.07,
      "end_seconds": 206.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.29,
      "end_seconds": 214.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Hmm, I take Glycomet, twice a day for my sugar."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.53,
      "end_seconds": 217.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.54,
      "end_seconds": 226.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "500 milligrams. Metoprolol. I take it 50 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.93,
      "end_seconds": 230.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "roughly how long on that one?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 232.4,
      "end_seconds": 233.95,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "For two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.97,
      "end_seconds": 240.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.17,
      "end_seconds": 253.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Okay, that's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.08,
      "end_seconds": 280.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 69, temp 36.6 degrees, BP is 112 over 80."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.75,
      "end_seconds": 285.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "hmm, um, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.45,
      "end_seconds": 290.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.19,
      "end_seconds": 297.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.57,
      "end_seconds": 301.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.62,
      "end_seconds": 320.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.3,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with mild tenderness low down and no pain in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.78,
      "end_seconds": 337.98,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "Right, all finished, thank you. Putting it all together, this looks most like a a lower urinary tract infection. I'd also keep vaginal irritation in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.36,
      "end_seconds": 342.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.54,
      "end_seconds": 374.82,
      "duration_seconds": 31.28,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a lower urinary tract infection is my leading thought, not anything worse. I want a urine culture done, that's for recurrent urinary infection. I'm going to order a urine test, for dysuria. We'll begin with nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, for three days. It's for urinary infection. Drink plenty of water and don't hold on when you need to go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.03,
      "end_seconds": 391.58,
      "duration_seconds": 15.55,
      "text": "Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. Let's plan a a check if it isn't better in three days. So, have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.88,
      "end_seconds": 395.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.85,
      "end_seconds": 398.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}